{
  "exportedAt" : "2026-11-20T18:54:58Z",
  "format" : "us.snelson.mezmorize.quotes",
  "quotes" : [
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "My dear brothers and sisters, the joy we feel has little to do with the circumstances of our lives and everything to do with the focus of our lives.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804999",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "The decision to serve a mission will shape the spiritual destiny of the missionary, his or her spouse, and their posterity for generations to come. A desire to serve is a natural outcome of one's conversion, worthiness, and preparation.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805030",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Your life will be a blessed and balanced experience if you first honor your identity and priority.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_381831",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Even more amazing than modern technology is our opportunity to access information directly from Heaven, without hardware, software, or monthly service fees.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805024",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "A covenant made with God should be regarded not as restrictive but as protective.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_190702",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Each day brings opportunity for decisions for eternity.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805014",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "It is important for you to know who you are and who you may become. It is more important than what you do, even as vital as your work is and will be.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_394300",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Irrespective of age, we mourn for those loved and lost. Mourning is one of the deepest expressions of pure love.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804950",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "I doubt that the Lord cares much which honorable vocation you choose. But He does care if you love one another and serve one another.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_392652",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "We teach that God's love for His children is infinite.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805038",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "As a medical doctor and cardiac surgeon, I had the responsibility of performing open-heart surgery on President Spencer W. Kimball in 1972, when he was Acting President of the Quorum of the Twelve Apostles.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805005",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Heavenly Father loves every one of His children. After all, He is their Father.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805034",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "I fear that too many have sadly surrendered their agency to the adversary and are saying by their conduct, 'I care more about satisfying my own desires than I do about bearing the Savior's power to bless others.'",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804995",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "We are all pleased when our names are pronounced and spelled correctly.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804964",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Contention does not usually begin as strife between countries. More often, it starts with an individual, for we can contend within ourselves over simple matters of right and wrong. From there, contention can infect neighbors and nations like a spreading sore.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804972",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Contention existed before the earth was formed.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804975",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "From an eternal perspective, the only death that is truly premature is the death of one who is not prepared to meet God.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805025",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Think of our physical sustenance. It is truly heaven-sent. The necessities of air, food, and water all come to us as gifts from a loving Heavenly Father.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805017",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Even the best teams can fail. Celebrities can fade. There is only One in whom your faith is always safe, and that is in the Lord Jesus Christ. And you need to let your faith show!",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805010",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "As we dread any disease that undermines the health of the body, so should we deplore contention, which is a corroding canker of the spirit.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804973",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "One of the most important concepts of revealed religion is that of a sacred covenant.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805020",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Preparation for a mission is important. A mission is a voluntary act of service to God and humankind. Missionaries support that privilege with their personal savings. Parents, families, friends, and donors to the General Missionary Fund may also assist.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805028",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Life is filled with detours and dead ends, trials and challenges of every kind. Each of us has likely had times when distress, anguish, and despair almost consumed us.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804996",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "We were born to die and we die to live. As seedlings of God, we barely blossom on earth; we fully flower in heaven.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_190703",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Obedience brings success; exact obedience brings miracles.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_802462",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Our Heavenly Father loves you. He has created you to be successful and to have joy.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804952",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "No, we don't own our children. Our parental privilege is to love them, to lead them, and to let them go.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804959",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "A faithful woman can become a devoted daughter of God - more concerned with being righteous than with being selfish, more anxious to exercise compassion than to exercise dominion, more committed to integrity than to notoriety. And she knows of her own infinite worth.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804969",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "As a medical doctor, I have known the face of adversity. I have seen much of death and dying, suffering and sorrow. I also remember the plight of students overwhelmed by their studies and of those striving to learn a foreign language. And I recall the fatigue and frustration felt by young parents with children in need.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804982",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Marriage and family are ordained of God. The family is the most important social unit in time and in eternity. Under God's great plan of happiness, families can be sealed in temples and be prepared to return to dwell in His holy presence forever. That is eternal life!",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805019",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Eternal principles that govern happiness apply equally to all.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_381832",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "When we speak of faith - the faith that can move mountains - we are not speaking of faith in general but of faith in the Lord Jesus Christ.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805008",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "While the family is under attack throughout the world, The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints proclaims, promotes, and protects the truth that the family is central to the Creator's plan for the eternal destiny of His children.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805037",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "The Sabbath provides a wonderful opportunity to strengthen family ties.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804990",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Saints can be happy under every circumstance.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804997",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "My concern is that contention is becoming accepted as a way of life.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804974",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Have you not learned that strength comes to an ordinary soul when given an extraordinary calling?",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804962",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "I worry about all who are impure in their thoughts, feelings, or actions or who demean their wives or children, thereby cutting off priesthood power.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804994",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Sometimes a nickname is used instead of the real name. But a nickname may offend either the one named or the parents who gave the name.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804965",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Many religious confessions share common values. They teach that we should do unto others as we would have them do unto us.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_390313",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Contemplation of life after retirement and life after death can help you deal with contemporary challenges.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_381833",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "As apostles and prophets, we are concerned not only for our children and grandchildren but for yours as well - and for each of God's children.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805026",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "The only length of life that seems to satisfy the longings of the human heart is life everlasting.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804949",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "You are never too young to learn, never too old to change.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805013",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "The only way to take sorrow out of death is to take love out of life.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804951",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "We can feel joy even while having a bad day, a bad week, or even a bad year!",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804998",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Each daughter of God is of infinite worth because of her divine mission.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804970",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "The wise use of your freedom to make your own decisions is crucial to your spiritual growth, now and for eternity.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805012",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Agency is a divine gift to you. You are free to choose what you will be and what you will do.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804954",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Married or single, you sisters possess distinctive capabilities and special intuition you have received as gifts from God. We brethren cannot duplicate your unique influence.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804987",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "We need women who are devoted to shepherding God's children along the covenant path toward exaltation; women who know how to receive personal revelation, who understand the power and peace of the temple endowment; women who know how to call upon the powers of heaven to protect and strengthen children and families; women who teach fearlessly.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804984",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "To understand the power of the priesthood, we must know its limitations.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804979",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "When I think of the love I feel for each member of our family, I sense, to a slight degree, the love that our Heavenly Father bears for His children.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805036",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "I believe that in the pursuit of education, individual desire is more influential than institution, and personal faith more forceful than faculty.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804946",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Every religious group, while perhaps a majority somewhere, is also inevitably a minority somewhere else. Thus, religious organizations should and do show tolerance toward members of other religious denominations.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_396156",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "A saint serves others, knowing that the more one serves, the greater the opportunity for the Spirit to sanctify and purify.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804966",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "How much better it would be if all could be more aware of God's providence and love and express that gratitude to Him.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_805016",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Service of any type requires preparation.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804978",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "I first found delight in the Sabbath many years ago when, as a busy surgeon, I knew that the Sabbath became a day for personal healing. By the end of each week, my hands were sore from repeatedly scrubbing them with soap, water, and a bristle brush. I also needed a breather from the burden of a demanding profession.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804988",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    },
    {
      "author" : "Russell M. Nelson",
      "quote" : "Many shoulder heavy burdens of righteous responsibility which, on occasion, seem so difficult to bear. I have heard those challenges termed impossible.",
      "sourceReference" : "https://www.brainyquote.com/quotes/russell_m_nelson_804981",
      "sourceTitle" : ""
    }
  ],
  "version" : 1
}
